{"type":"text","timestamp":1794561223855,"sessionID":"ses_e2bd34d8effe9ZeAv34d1wqUl4","part":{"id":"prt_1d42f1a08002EjkE6mgmRu7x2L","sessionID":"ses_e2bd34d8effe9ZeAv34d1wqUl4","messageID":"msg_1d42effc2001HQ96Eq7OJ1DOkD","type":"text","text":"T055 is done: two sentences changed in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md`, and the Verify command passes.\n\n**Verify output** (`$RA` is that README):\n\n1. `rg -c \"whose brief arrived\" $RA` printed nothing, exit 1 (expected: nothing).\n2. `rg -c \"not shown missing\" $RA` printed `1`, exit 0 (expected: 1).\n3. `rg -c \"leave out every holdout row\" $RA` printed `1`, exit 0 (expected: 1).\n\n**Edits**\n\n- Scorer row: replaced the `offerReached` clause with \"counts offers whose brief was not shown missing, so a row whose brief state is unknown counts\".\n- Capture row: added \"Its `rows`, `attachedRows` and `typedRows` maps leave out every holdout row, so only holdout counts are published.\" after the attached-hit sentence.\n\n**Evidence behind the wording.** `score-command-transcripts.mjs:1292` increments `offerReached` unless `briefDelivered === false`, so an unknown brief counts. `capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:515`, `:531` and `:542` gate all three maps on `row.split !== 'holdout'` while every tally still counts the row.\n\n**State.** Only that README was edited, and the T055 checkbox in `tasks.md` is left unticked as instructed. The file's `git diff` also carries T053 and T054 text from a concurrent worker (the file table, `Code files | 14`, the runner exit 3 and arena refusal text). I did not touch or revert any of it. Nothing was committed, and no other file was modified.\n\n**Not done.** Nothing. No verification step failed, so no retry was needed.\n\n**Inferred rather than observed.** That no other holdout row can reach the published maps through another path. I read the three assignment sites, not every branch of the scorer.\n\n**Residual risk.** None known for this doc edit, though the sentence describes behavior from T040 that is present on disk now.\n\nNothing is blocked on you.","time":{"start":1794561219080,"end":1794561223855}}}
